# Large research PDFs (many bundle embedded video / high-res supplements and
# run to hundreds of MB) are tracked with Git LFS. The pointer is committed
# here; the bytes live in a LOCAL store (see tools/lfs-localstore.py and the
# repo-local `lfs.standalonetransferagent` config), not on GitHub.
research/**/*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
